WEBVTT

00:00:07.803 --> 00:00:10.539
* La, la, la, la...

00:00:10.573 --> 00:00:12.007
* Aah...
(grunts)

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.509
(all gasp for breath)

00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:15.511
(all resume singing)

00:00:15.544 --> 00:00:18.881
*

00:00:18.914 --> 00:00:20.048
* Ah...

00:00:20.082 --> 00:00:22.518
-(final chords play)
-(streamers whistling)

00:00:22.551 --> 00:00:24.653
(cheering)

00:00:24.687 --> 00:00:27.155
(whooping, cheering)

00:00:27.189 --> 00:00:28.957
-Hey, you!
-Freeze!

00:00:28.991 --> 00:00:30.859
Don't move!

00:00:30.893 --> 00:00:32.828
Hands in the air!

00:00:34.196 --> 00:00:36.499
(birds chirping)

00:00:39.402 --> 00:00:40.703
Ah...

00:00:40.736 --> 00:00:44.006
Face it, Gru,
villainy is in your blood.

00:00:44.039 --> 00:00:47.543
You can't tell me you
don't miss the rush, a little?

00:00:47.576 --> 00:00:48.677
Uh...

00:00:48.711 --> 00:00:50.513
yeah, maybe a little.
(chuckles)

00:00:50.546 --> 00:00:53.248
And now you've got the chance
to get back on top,

00:00:53.281 --> 00:00:54.817
get your mojo back,

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.485
become Gru again.

00:00:56.519 --> 00:00:59.388
How awesome would that be?

00:00:59.422 --> 00:01:00.856
Hmm.

00:01:00.889 --> 00:01:02.491
Oh, please, come on.

00:01:02.525 --> 00:01:04.827
(whispers):
Just one heist.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.164
There's got to be something
out there, somewhere,

00:01:09.197 --> 00:01:12.535
that you still want to steal.

00:01:14.102 --> 00:01:15.337
Hmm.

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:17.205
There is something.

00:01:17.239 --> 00:01:19.908
-(gasps)
-How about we steal...

00:01:19.942 --> 00:01:23.345
the largest diamond
in the world!

00:01:23.378 --> 00:01:24.713
Yes!

00:01:24.747 --> 00:01:26.214
I love it!

00:01:26.248 --> 00:01:28.350
* Ooh, ooh!
Oh, thank you, Brother!

00:01:28.383 --> 00:01:30.553
Thank you from the bottoms
of my heart!

00:01:30.586 --> 00:01:33.722
-Oh! Ooh-ooh-ooh!
-Ha-ha! Whoo-hoo-hoo!

00:01:33.756 --> 00:01:36.692
Oh, you know what? We should
do something to celebrate!

00:01:36.725 --> 00:01:38.126
Oh-ho-ho!

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.096
I have got the perfect idea.

00:01:41.129 --> 00:01:43.966
(Agnes chewing noisily)

00:01:43.999 --> 00:01:45.267
Fritz, my good fellow,

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.536
could you get me
another napkin, please?

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:50.272
Ah, yes. Of course, Miss Edith.

00:01:50.305 --> 00:01:51.907
(air horn blares)

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.442
(Minions laughing)

00:01:53.476 --> 00:01:54.610
What?!

00:01:54.643 --> 00:01:55.944
(laughing)

00:01:55.978 --> 00:01:57.946
Hey, where are Gru and Dru?

00:01:57.980 --> 00:01:59.882
Here we are!

00:01:59.915 --> 00:02:02.117
Oh. How's it going?

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:03.552
(both snickering)

00:02:03.586 --> 00:02:05.287
It's me, Gru.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.155
And me, Dru.

00:02:07.189 --> 00:02:08.791
(Gru snickering)

00:02:08.824 --> 00:02:11.994
I hug everybody
whether they like it or not.

00:02:12.027 --> 00:02:14.296
Why are they pretending
to be each other?

00:02:14.329 --> 00:02:15.964
(Edith scoffs)

00:02:15.998 --> 00:02:17.600
Oh. What's for dinner?

00:02:17.633 --> 00:02:19.768
I probably won't like it.

00:02:19.802 --> 00:02:21.970
I'm so grumpy all the time.

00:02:22.004 --> 00:02:23.438
(grunts)

00:02:23.472 --> 00:02:25.007
Hey, I laugh a lot.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.075
(snickers):
And I'm kind of an idiot.

00:02:27.109 --> 00:02:30.779
(Gru and Dru
laughing hysterically)

00:02:37.119 --> 00:02:39.154
Oh, I'm busting a gut.

00:02:39.187 --> 00:02:40.789
Look at them!

00:02:40.823 --> 00:02:42.791
They have no idea! (laughing)

00:02:42.825 --> 00:02:44.927
GRU:
Total burn.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.962
Oh, look, it's me, Gru!

00:02:46.995 --> 00:02:48.430
And I'm Dru!

00:02:48.463 --> 00:02:50.165
-We switched places!
-(both laughing)

00:02:50.198 --> 00:02:52.935
Oh, it's so nice to see
you two are getting along.

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:54.302
Oh, we're getting...

00:02:54.336 --> 00:02:56.271
Along perfectly.

00:02:56.304 --> 00:02:58.106
-Wait. Did we...
-Just finish...

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:59.107
-Each...
-Other's...

00:02:59.141 --> 00:03:00.175
BOTH:
Sentences?

00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:01.209
(both laughing)

00:03:01.243 --> 00:03:02.645
Oh, that's delightful.

00:03:02.678 --> 00:03:04.146
Not creepy at all.

00:03:04.179 --> 00:03:05.648
And you're gonna stop now,
though, right?

00:03:05.681 --> 00:03:07.683
Sorry, it's a twin thing.

00:03:07.716 --> 00:03:09.217
Uh-huh.

00:03:09.251 --> 00:03:12.220
So, uh, what did
you guys do today?

00:03:12.254 --> 00:03:13.321
(Agnes chewing noisily)

00:03:13.355 --> 00:03:15.157
GRU and DRU:
Nothing.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.525
Okay. What does it...

00:03:16.559 --> 00:03:17.793
All done.

00:03:17.826 --> 00:03:19.027
(panting):
Pardon me.

00:03:19.061 --> 00:03:20.295
-Out of the way.
-(Fritz gasps)

00:03:20.328 --> 00:03:21.997
-Good night, everybody!
-Hey, hey, hey.

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:23.899
Put the brakes on.
What's the rush?

00:03:23.932 --> 00:03:26.802
I need to get to bed so I can
wake up and find a unicorn!

00:03:26.835 --> 00:03:29.404
Good night!

00:03:29.437 --> 00:03:31.239
What was that about?

00:03:31.273 --> 00:03:33.475
Agnes thinks she's gonna
find a real unicorn

00:03:33.508 --> 00:03:34.910
in the woods tomorrow.

00:03:34.943 --> 00:03:37.012
(chuckles)
She's totally freaking out.

00:03:37.045 --> 00:03:39.481
(sighs) I feel like someone's
got to tell her the truth.

00:03:39.514 --> 00:03:40.749
Not it!

00:03:40.783 --> 00:03:42.718
Oh, don't worry.

00:03:42.751 --> 00:03:44.052
Parenting 101.

00:03:44.086 --> 00:03:47.590
I got this.

00:03:47.623 --> 00:03:50.893
Um, and please bless
that when I find the unicorn,

00:03:50.926 --> 00:03:53.662
he'll want to come home with me
and sleep in my room.

00:03:53.696 --> 00:03:56.765
-And that I can ride him
to school every day. -(sighs)

00:03:56.799 --> 00:04:00.669
And he'll use his magical
powers to help me do math.

00:04:00.703 --> 00:04:03.238
Amen.

00:04:03.271 --> 00:04:04.673
(door creaks softly)

00:04:04.707 --> 00:04:06.108
Oh. Hi, Gru.

00:04:06.141 --> 00:04:07.843
Hey.

00:04:07.876 --> 00:04:11.013
So, big day tomorrow.

00:04:11.046 --> 00:04:13.616
Yeah, I'm finally gonna
get to see a unicorn.

00:04:13.649 --> 00:04:15.050
For reals.

00:04:15.083 --> 00:04:17.552
(gasps) If I do,
can I bring it home?

00:04:17.586 --> 00:04:18.687
Please?

00:04:18.721 --> 00:04:20.756
Oh, yeah, sure.

00:04:20.789 --> 00:04:23.792
Tell you what,
every unicorn you find,

00:04:23.826 --> 00:04:25.427
you can bring it home.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:28.563
I'd better build
a big pen, right?

00:04:28.597 --> 00:04:31.767
But, you know...

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:35.270
there's a chance
that you might not find one.

00:04:35.303 --> 00:04:37.372
Huh?

00:04:37.405 --> 00:04:39.274
Uh, um...

00:04:39.307 --> 00:04:43.278
It might not be
good unicorn-finding weather.

00:04:45.447 --> 00:04:49.718
Um, they're tricky
to find them.

00:04:49.752 --> 00:04:53.388
And I don't know, maybe ju...

00:04:53.421 --> 00:04:56.925
maybe... unicorns

00:04:56.959 --> 00:05:00.729
don't really ex...

00:05:00.763 --> 00:05:05.768
explore that...
part of the woods.

00:05:05.801 --> 00:05:06.969
(chuckles)

00:05:07.002 --> 00:05:08.470
(sobs softly)

00:05:08.503 --> 00:05:10.906
B-But the man said

00:05:10.939 --> 00:05:13.809
a maiden could find one
if she was pure in heart.

00:05:13.842 --> 00:05:16.745
And I'm pure in heart, right?

00:05:16.779 --> 00:05:19.014
The purest.

00:05:21.149 --> 00:05:23.351
(Agnes sighs)

00:05:23.385 --> 00:05:25.120
Can we stop talking now?

00:05:25.153 --> 00:05:26.855
(whispers):
I need to get to sleep.

00:05:26.889 --> 00:05:28.356
Good night, sweetie.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.159
Good night, Gru.

00:05:31.193 --> 00:05:33.595
* Unicorns,
I love them *

00:05:33.628 --> 00:05:36.164
* Unicorns, I love them.

00:05:37.299 --> 00:05:39.167
(screams, grunts)

00:05:40.869 --> 00:05:44.039
I'm okay. (groans)

00:05:44.072 --> 00:05:46.675
* Hold on to me

00:05:46.709 --> 00:05:47.710
(snapping rhythmically
to music)

00:05:47.743 --> 00:05:48.977
* Don't let me go

00:05:49.011 --> 00:05:50.813
* Who cares what they see

00:05:50.846 --> 00:05:52.447
Hey! Give that back!

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.717
-(shouting in Minionese)
-(grunts) Guys!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.019
-(Minions clamoring)
-* Your first name is Free

00:05:57.052 --> 00:05:58.887
Oh, no. Run!

00:05:58.921 --> 00:06:00.555
(inmates scream)

00:06:00.588 --> 00:06:02.858
-* We choose to believe
-(snapping rhythmically)

00:06:02.891 --> 00:06:04.860
* In where we're from

00:06:04.893 --> 00:06:06.862
-(inmate gasps)
-* Man's red flower

00:06:06.895 --> 00:06:08.063
-(toy squeaks)
-(inmate sobs)

00:06:08.096 --> 00:06:10.298
* It's in every living thing

00:06:10.332 --> 00:06:11.299
* Mind, use your power

00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:12.868
(inmates grunting)

00:06:12.901 --> 00:06:14.903
* Spirit, use your wings

00:06:14.937 --> 00:06:17.405
-(needle buzzing)
-* Freedom

00:06:18.506 --> 00:06:19.674
* Freedom

00:06:20.743 --> 00:06:22.044
* Freedom

00:06:23.111 --> 00:06:24.179
* Freedom...

00:06:24.212 --> 00:06:26.815
We've been waiting a long time.

00:06:26.849 --> 00:06:28.683
-Can we... (gasping) No! No!
-Yeah! Yeah!

00:06:28.717 --> 00:06:30.218
Ow! No, please!

00:06:30.252 --> 00:06:31.319
(gasps)

00:06:31.353 --> 00:06:34.522
Gru?

00:06:34.556 --> 00:06:35.924
Uh, oh.

00:06:35.958 --> 00:06:37.926
(gasps)

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.895
(sobbing softly)

00:06:46.268 --> 00:06:48.036
(chuckles)

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:48.971
(grunts)

00:06:52.274 --> 00:06:53.876
(sobbing)

00:06:55.944 --> 00:06:59.614
(speaking Minionese)

00:06:59.647 --> 00:07:01.049
(laughing)

00:07:01.083 --> 00:07:02.617
(sputtering)

00:07:04.787 --> 00:07:07.455
(grunting)

00:07:07.489 --> 00:07:10.425
(sighs)

00:07:10.458 --> 00:07:11.626
Hmm?

00:07:11.659 --> 00:07:13.561
(gasps)

00:07:16.664 --> 00:07:20.135
* La-la-la-la, la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la... *

00:07:20.168 --> 00:07:21.469
(inmates chattering)

00:07:21.503 --> 00:07:22.938
(chuckles)

00:07:22.971 --> 00:07:24.907
(speaking Minionese excitedly)

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:25.941
...Gru!

00:07:25.974 --> 00:07:28.911
(speaks Minionese)
...Gru!

00:07:28.944 --> 00:07:31.246
-(Minions cheering, clamoring)
-* Freedom

00:07:31.279 --> 00:07:33.381
* Freedom.

00:07:33.415 --> 00:07:35.417
(to Olivia Newton-John's
"Physical"): * Because I'm

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:37.886
* Training for the big day

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.322
* Nobody's gonna stop me

00:07:40.355 --> 00:07:42.958
* 'Cause I am super sassy

00:07:42.991 --> 00:07:44.626
* Super sassy, super sassy...

00:07:44.659 --> 00:07:45.828
(Clive beeps)

00:07:45.861 --> 00:07:48.496
What's today's plan, boss?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.898
What's the plan? (chuckles)

00:07:49.932 --> 00:07:50.966
Silly robot.

00:07:50.999 --> 00:07:52.567
I'll show you the plan.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.603
Time to watch a very special
episode of Evil Bratt,

00:07:55.637 --> 00:07:59.574
to see exactly what I'm gonna
do to stupid Tinseltown.

00:07:59.607 --> 00:08:00.742
(theme music playing)

00:08:00.775 --> 00:08:03.345
ANNOUNCER:
This week on Evil Bratt...

00:08:03.378 --> 00:08:04.980
(crowd screaming)

00:08:05.013 --> 00:08:08.116
It's a giant Evil Bratt robot!

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.451
Open fire!

00:08:09.484 --> 00:08:10.986
I have him in my sights!

00:08:11.019 --> 00:08:13.488
(gunfire)

00:08:14.823 --> 00:08:16.658
Nice try, coppers.

00:08:16.691 --> 00:08:17.993
Chew on this!

00:08:19.661 --> 00:08:21.196
(officer screams)

00:08:21.229 --> 00:08:24.499
He's shooting his super sticky,
self-inflating gum!

00:08:24.532 --> 00:08:26.134
(gasping) Run!

00:08:26.168 --> 00:08:27.435
(soldiers screaming)

00:08:27.469 --> 00:08:29.604
Gum one, gum all.

00:08:29.637 --> 00:08:31.206
(laughs)

00:08:31.239 --> 00:08:33.375
(laughs)
"Gum one, gum all."

00:08:33.408 --> 00:08:36.511
Seriously, how did this show
never win an Emmy?

00:08:39.181 --> 00:08:43.151
And now, it's your turn
to shine, my diamond.

00:08:43.185 --> 00:08:44.719
(electronic sound effects)

